  "job_B3.3.28_20251003_114714": {
    "chunk_text": "Of Seinte Neote. M\u00e6n \u00fea leofeste, we wylle\u00f0 eow cy\u00f0en beo sumen d\u00e6le emb \u00feyssen halgen, \u00fee we tod\u00e6ig wur\u00f0ige\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t Hit s\u00e6g\u00f0 on \u00fean halgen godspelle, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t liht on Godes gela\u00f0unge na behydd beon ne sceal, ac up asett Swa eac ne mihte Sanctus Neotus behydd beon ne bedigelod, \u00fea \u00fea God hine geupped habben wolde. He w\u00e6s on iuge\u00f0e, \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee bec secge\u00f0, to boclicre lare gesett, & to godcunden \u00feeawen becom, & georne Swa hit awriten is, \u00fe\u00e6t se weig is sticol & neare, \u00fee to \u00fean ecen life belimp\u00f0, & nan mann \u00fe\u00e6r to ne Swa dyde Sanctus Neotus, forh\u00e6fde hine sylfne fram gelustfullunge \u00feysses lifes. He w\u00e6s man\u00f0w\u00e6re & milde ealle mannen & he d\u00e6ighwamlice to his Drihtene clypode \u00e6fter Dauides Do beo me \u00e6fter \u00feinre mildheortnysse & t\u00e6c me \u00feine rihtwisnysse. So\u00f0lice \u00fe\u00e6t ilca gebed us is alefd, gyf we wylle\u00f0 inweardlice to Gode clypigen & his mildheortnysse Hit s\u00e6ig\u00f0 on gewritan, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fees halge were to Gl\u00e6stingebyrig gecerred w\u00e6re on Sanctes \u00e6lfeges dagen & his salmes & o\u00f0re gebedan he geornlice beeode d\u00e6iges & nihtes. & his gewune w\u00e6s, \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde on d\u00e6ig gelomen his cneowe gebegen, & eac swylce on niht to \u00fean He gemunde symle his synnen, \u00fee he on his iuge\u00f0e gefremede",
